; on_abort — runs on every abort ([RS274NGC] ON_ABORT_COMMAND).
; Flush air off, drawbar up (tool clamped), X limit back to the work area
; (tool change area off), X/Y acceleration restored, dust hood up/down
; pulses cleared (the hood keeps its position).

o<on_abort> sub
  M65 P7
  M65 P0
  M65 P8
  M65 P1
  M65 P2
  o<accel_restore> call
o<on_abort> endsub
M2
